{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0d42c31feb047b48b083c98a622e68b78b577b3ff34b2d92f2b91b12595aa9fa",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a23d5d57162f7d732b15721b20ff3944f8e4c0083f46fd649c85843414b5211",
      "text": "制作人……！突然打电话抱歉啊。\n就在刚才，发生了一件超厉害的事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3114232fe53163e7e865b92ba0e38b3ac3cf77cbb674c33266b3ed0444921893",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0795f126eef16a11feff0e66337faa09558d5e4cefa57f228de0d132ebcbe8fb",
      "text": "我去买东西的时候，看到文具专柜上\n贴了我们的海报。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ede3d890311fe5b1280e0ac824360b218144f967e07c0c9faa2d95d94f8c332e",
      "text": "看到那张海报的人，看着我的打扮说\n看起来很成熟、真想在这样的公司上班什么的，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06169eab21cd1e30d4a1fbcafb9874dddfbe1736a2d0dfb3df3714134da8d8cc",
      "text": "我亲耳听到他们这么夸我呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:117cb994d6f230db0d4558f87d03e1b273d38088a03b6c282107cdbe08e0d72a",
      "text": "虽说听说要演社长时吓了一跳，\n但全力以赴果然没有白费啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:917991b87bf8be62b3a932e3fcd07c18d5e494416564c31e878a3c1ecc90934b",
      "text": "朱雀先生的热情\n传达到了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da48011a08373726e1ee47a6fafe4ed99f2223719398369bc6e95fa76ad05747",
      "text": "是个非常可靠的\n社长哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:675ae4e549d7def94de2b185dabef255d0d45fb6e00b1361efc344b5e6765479",
      "text": "连●●●●プロデューサー都这么说……！\n呜～太高兴啦！谢谢你啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4f8295ba276d2bb4526802ed611ae5333ab617a9e30abfa4af344b852c47388",
      "text": "后来，他们还买了联名的文具呢。\n因为穿着西装，肯定已经是上班族了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eb9ea4b7acaf2a58468fedd7cf6a011dc5b50e3dbfe57c5695bab25bb5c40db",
      "text": "那些人要是能用着那些文具、\n开开心心地工作就好了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50e9589043f4a7bfe3ed82df1bfdee6e04216e85b2c7a5df585c0dd712af6c21",
      "text": "为了能成为更有型的大人，我也得\n好好加油才行。噢噢噢，燃起来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_a:2_4_025_03_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75beb640422f42e3583df664ed0ee52ba6772ab5d495afe5b0123c9ae7ccbdb8",
      "text": "哎呀，为此也得把作业赶紧\n搞定才行啊。那明天见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
